Conductor Quick Ticket

Mobile UI designs for a bus conductor's ticket-issuing app, using the 500D to Silk Board route as the example. The app is built for one-handed use on a moving bus: dark theme, large tap targets, and clear status at every step. It focuses on two things: issuing tickets in a few taps, and making sure a passenger is never charged twice when something goes wrong.

